full-query: "You have enabled CloudTrail in your AWS account and stored the trail logs in CloudWatch Logs. In the CloudWatch Log Group, you plan to create a new subscription filter to deliver the logs to an Amazon Kinesis stream for real-time processing. You have a Kinesis stream in place and the stream ARN is \"arn:aws:kinesis:us-east-1:123456789012:stream/Test\" When creating the subscription filter through AWS CLI \"aws logs put-subscription-filter\", you need an IAM role to provide the required permission. Which IAM permission policy should the IAM role have?"
