  "answer": "<p>The <strong>\"{ 'Statement': [ { 'Effect': 'Allow', 'Action': 'kinesis:PutRecord', 'Resource': 'arn:aws:kinesis:us-east-1:123456789012:stream/Test' } ] }\"</strong> permission is required because CloudWatch Logs needs explicit rights to push each log event to the Kinesis stream using the <code>PutRecord</code> action. This policy specifically allows the IAM role to send records to the designated stream and is a best practice for integrating CloudWatch Logs with Kinesis for streaming.</p><p>Option <i>\"{ 'Statement': [ { 'Effect': 'Allow', 'Action': 'kinesis:CreateStream', 'Resource': 'arn:aws:kinesis:us-east-1:123456789012:stream/Test' } ] }\"</i> is incorrect because this allows creating a new Kinesis stream, but does not grant permission to write records to an existing one.</p><p>The policy <i>\"{ 'Statement': [ { 'Effect': 'Deny', 'Action': 'kinesis:PutRecord', 'Condition': {'ArnNotEquals': {'aws:SourceArn': 'arn:aws:kinesis:us-east-1:123456789012:stream/Test'}} } ] }\"</i> only restricts <code>PutRecord</code> access based on conditions but does not grant any permissions that would let CloudWatch Logs write to the stream.</p><p>The statement <i>\"{ 'Statement': [ { 'Effect': 'Allow', 'Action': 'kinesis:PutRecord', 'Principal': 'arn:aws:kinesis:us-east-1:123456789012:stream/Test', 'Resource': 'logs.us-east-1.amazonaws.com' } ] }\"</i> is not valid IAM syntax for this purpose; it incorrectly specifies a principal and resource, which is unsuitable for granting CloudWatch Logs permission to call <code>PutRecord</code> on the stream.</p><p><strong>Tip:</strong> Always grant only the minimal necessary permissions and use resource-level restrictions where possible to ensure security best practices when integrating AWS services.</p>",
  "query": "<p>An organization has configured AWS CloudTrail and is storing logs within Amazon CloudWatch Logs. The team wants to add a subscription filter that streams CloudWatch log events directly to an existing Kinesis stream with ARN <code>arn:aws:kinesis:us-east-1:123456789012:stream/Test</code> for real-time processing. When using the AWS CLI to run <code>aws logs put-subscription-filter</code>, which IAM policy is required on the role so that CloudWatch Logs can publish logs to this particular Kinesis stream?</p>",
  "original_oid": "6793da9561969b416038a24c",
