  "originalQuery": "You have enabled CloudTrail in your AWS account and stored the trail logs in CloudWatch Logs.\nIn the CloudWatch Log Group, you plan to create a new subscription filter to deliver the logs to an Amazon Kinesis stream for real-time processing.\nYou have a Kinesis stream in place and the stream ARN is \"arn:aws:kinesis:us-east-1:123456789012:stream/Test\"\nWhen creating the subscription filter through AWS CLI \"aws logs put-subscription-filter\", you need an IAM role to provide the required permission.\nWhich IAM permission policy should the IAM role have?",
  "originalOptions": "[\"A. { \\\"Statement\\\": [ { \\\"Effect\\\": \\\"Allow\\\", \\\"Action\\\": \\\"kinesis:CreateStream\\\", \\\"Resource\\\": \\\"arn:aws:kinesis:us-east-1:123456789012:stream/Test\\\" } ] }\",\"B. { \\\"Statement\\\": [ { \\\"Effect\\\": \\\"Deny\\\", \\\"Action\\\": \\\"kinesis:PutRecord\\\", \\\"Condition\\\": {\\\"ArnNotEquals\\\": {\\\"aws:SourceArn\\\": \\\"arn:aws:kinesis:us-east-1:123456789012:stream/Test\\\"}} } ] }\",\"C. { \\\"Statement\\\": [ { \\\"Effect\\\": \\\"Allow\\\", \\\"Action\\\": \\\"kinesis:PutRecord\\\", \\\"Resource\\\": \\\"arn:aws:kinesis:us-east-1:123456789012:stream/Test\\\" } ] }\",\"D. { \\\"Statement\\\": [ { \\\"Effect\\\": \\\"Allow\\\", \\\"Action\\\": \\\"kinesis:PutRecord\\\", \\\"Principal\\\": \\\"arn:aws:kinesis:us-east-1:123456789012:stream/Test\\\", \\\"Resource\\\": \\\"logs.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\\\" } ] }\"]",
